## Tasks

You have access to a task list in the `gg.tasks.Tasks` module. Use `{{api.tasks.add_task.call}}` to add
work, `{{api.tasks.update_task.call}}` to update a task's data, `{{api.tasks.complete_task.call}}` to mark a
